WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.430
[Light footsteps and typing; a wooden click presses Replay]

00:02.430 --> 00:03.850
[A sweep opens the window; a low impact marks eight failed tests]

00:03.850 --> 00:05.850
[Soft air follows the camera into the character's reaction, then a quiet pause]

00:05.850 --> 00:08.720
[A grip, a sliding sound, and a release; the playhead opens into an edit]

00:08.720 --> 00:12.200
[Quiet inspection; small wooden clicks and a soft note mark the clue]

00:12.200 --> 00:15.000
[The corrected word gains an underline; air follows it into the test result]

00:15.000 --> 00:16.950
[A warm chord for fourteen passed tests; a jump and two gentle landings]

00:16.950 --> 00:20.000
[The result's fine rule opens the actual product; light rhythm returns]

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
[A grip at the window edge, a small click, and a carrying sweep; a final warm chord settles]
